ens at score 0.698. Targeted semantic retrieval also ranks the newly discovered batching defect pm-vjgqj5 first at score 0.831. The rebuild ratio exposed that the Ollama character ceiling defeats configured batching; that performance defect is separately tracked rather than weakening the functional search claim."}]}],"before_hash":"24d8f05ec957593980527dfa67a2f6d6a8fd4767f33b67461d58fc737d6b14a1","after_hash":"ec61b717bc7aad9604b320b5a7f059abb639b92112ca86ce266678d7cd9be326","item_hash_version":2,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"version":{"status":"unavailable","reason":"harness_unavailable","resolver":"ai_agent_version","rule_version":"v1"}}}}
